  "description": "Team Sync Advisor provides managers with concise summaries of team check-ins, highlights areas needing attention, and suggests relevant follow-up questions. It also offers individualized, detailed summaries for each team member, including tailored follow-up prompts to support effective conversations and drive team engagement based on based on the selected check-in template and the date range in which the check-ins were created.",
